msgid "AIYEEH! YOU REALLY ARE SCARY"
msgstr "AIYEEH! T'ES VRAIMENT FLIPPANT"

msgid "AIYEEH!! I AM SORRY!!"
msgstr "AIYEEH!! JE SUIS DÉSOLÉ!!"

msgid "AIYEEH!! NO WATER PLEASE"
